          "quote": "Krishna co-founded Crane and has been fortunate to have had the opportunity to back European founders for 27 years, investing across every layer of the enterprise stack. Prior to VC, he had several operational roles including co-founding a deep tech start-up. … Scott co-founded Crane and has been backing European founders for 20 years. He previously spent time in marketing, strategy, research and finance roles before becoming a venture capitalist. … Carlos is Head of APAC and Partner at Crane Venture Partners, based in Singapore. Previously, he served as a Principal at MassMutual Ventures, where he helped establish the firm's presence in the APAC and Europe. … Roy is a Managing Director at Crane, where he leads investments in AI and Deeptech across India and APAC. He joins Crane following over a decade at Sequoia Capital India & Southeast Asia (now Peak XV), where he was an early-stage investor and a key contributor to the Surge program.",
